OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween home transformation with
OL,4,Aprops and skip waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FA roofer from Surrey has transformed
OL,7,Fhis home into a spooky haunted house
OL,8,Ffor Halloween, hoping to raise
OL,9,Fthousands of pounds in the process.
OL,11,FDavid Donovan's home in Hillside,
OL,12,FBanstead, usually looks like any other
OL,13,Fbut this week has a 10ft (3m) skeleton,
OL,14,Fa gory scarecrow and a gruesome
OL,15,Fgraveyard outside.
OL,17,FHe has been collecting the giant props
OL,18,Ffor years and builds the scene for the
OL,19,Fannual event largely from building
OL,20,Fwaste materials and what he finds in
OL,21,Fskips.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
